, "name": "max_duration", "link": 87, "label": "max_duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "max_duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 48, "type": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"seed": true, "top_k": true, "caption": true, "lyrics": true, "max_duration": true, "cfg_scale": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [848.9822998046875, 89.07875061035156], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [1711.1387939453125, 1720.9228515625], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 62, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 10, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 24, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "输入提示词☝\n建议把官方SKILL给Gemini,让它给你按SKILL写标准提示词。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#29d145"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [87], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "color": "#149446", "widgets_values": [240.00000000000006], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Float", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#008032", "size": [367.991455078125, 68.39634704589844], "pos": [2602.08447265625, 1631.186279296875], "id": 65, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Float"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "links": [86], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "color": "#149446", "widgets_values": ["### Global Metadata\n* Genre & Style: 90s J-Pop / Folk Rock / Classic Cantopop\n* Tempo: Mid-tempo (86 BPM), driving and rhythmic 4/4 folk-rock groove\n* Emotional Arc: Poetic, free-spirited, and uplifting warmth seamlessly evolving into deep family happiness\n* Production Profile: Nostalgic late-90s analogue acoustic rock production. Dominated by bright, continuous 12-string acoustic guitar strumming, prominent piano chords, warm electric bass, and crisp pop-rock drums with a spacious open room sound.\n\n### Vocal Details\n* Lead Vocal: Male lead, high-tenor register, bright, airy, and free-flowing tone. Effortless legato phrasing with crystal-clear head-voice accents, inspired by classic Asian acoustic rock balladeers.\n* Backing Vocals: Floating octave backing vocals and spacious \"ah\" harmonies during choruses.\n* Vocal Effects: Wide stereo plate reverb and slight analog delay, creating an airy, lifted, and open vocal presence.\n\n### Arrangement\n* Intro: Starts immediately with bright, rhythmic 12-string acoustic guitar strumming and a iconic, sweeping piano hook. Drums and bass hit together on beat 1, creating a strong, energetic 90s pop-rock opening.\n* Verse 1: Driving acoustic guitar rhythm continues non-stop. Clear male lead vocal sings cleanly over the acoustic guitar and steady bassline, with subtle piano fills.\n* Pre-Chorus: Snare drum builds up the rhythm, acoustic guitar strumming becomes more dynamic, swelling smoothly into the main chorus melody.\n* Chorus: Full folk-rock band explosion. Sparkling acoustic guitars, ringing piano chords, driving rock drumbeat, and soaring pop strings create an expansive, triumphant melody.\n* Verse 2: Dynamic drops slightly but keeps the driving acoustic guitar strumming pace, reflecting ten years of shared memories.\n* Chorus: Full energy returns with rich vocal harmonies and lifted acoustic rhythm.\n* Bridge: Acoustic guitar drops to clean quarter-note strumming alongside piano chords. As the story mentions home and son \"Tiantian\" (天天), soaring string countermelodies build up to a bright, radiant peak.\n* Final Chorus: Maximum energy. Full pop-rock band with soaring strings and layered harmonies, delivering a passionate, joyful celebration.\n* Outro: Drums fade, leaving the iconic 12-string acoustic guitar strumming and piano melody to play out together, ending on a crisp acoustic ring."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#008032", "size": [399.7449951171875, 619.1534423828125], "pos": [1719.1424560546875, 1080.518310546875], "id": 64, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "links": [85], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "color": "#149446", "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\n(Instrumental)\n\n[Verse 1]\n高铁站的站台 伫立着我的等待\n厨房里的烟火 升腾起爱的饭菜\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n一起去尝遍 街角巷尾的精彩\n在电影院里 看着别人的爱情表白\n牵着你的手 在美丽的公园呼吸着新鲜的空气\n\n[Chorus]\n飞哥，我的爱飞\n一见钟情是我们的开场白\n跨越城市的列车 奔向最温暖的偏爱\n\n[Verse 2]\n异地两年的期盼 变成了十年的相守\n岁月的微风 吹过我们牵紧的手\n\n[Chorus]\n飞哥，我的爱飞\n时光沉淀出最美的期待\n平凡的日子里 都是最浪漫的编排\n\n[Bridge]\n如今有了我们温馨的小家\n还有我们聪明可爱的天天\n看着他笑弯的眉眼 就像看到了你的模样\n\n[Final Chorus]\n飞哥，我的爱飞\n这十年的故事 盛开得如此绚烂\n有你，有天天，这就是最完美的答案\n\n[Outro]\n我的爱妃，我的飞哥……\n(Fade out)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#008032", "size": [399.7449951171875, 619.1534423828125], "pos": [2151.407470703125, 1079.955810546875], "id": 63, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 10}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.48.7", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-1